  "reason": "The operating cash flow calculation is incorrect. Net income is $6,857 - $478 = $6,379. Add back share-based compensation: $118 - $11 = $107. Add other operating activities: $21 - $82 = -$61. Total: $6,379 + $107 - $61 = $6,425, not $8,379. The reported $8,379 exceeds the correct sum by $1,954. ASC 230-10-45-1 requires proper reconciliation of net income to net cash from operating activities."
